              {
                "detail": "No required environment variables are declared. Optional env vars are referenced in docs (OPENCLAW_WORKSPACE, DASHBOARD_AUTH_MODE, DASHBOARD_TOKEN, PORT), which are reasonable for configuration and authentication. Integrations (Slack, Linear, Discord) are present in the example config but disabled by default — enabling them would require the corresponding API keys. Overall, requested environment access is proportional; users should be aware enabling integrations or remote auth modes will require secrets and network exposure.",
